# The notebook's environment (master plan item 18): Python 3.12, Linux.
# It runs the training stack and the runtime code in one kernel, so it is
# the training set, constrained to the training lock, plus the runtime's
# own pins from requirements.in and requirements_lock.txt (numpy is the
# one package both locks pin, and the training lock's pin wins here),
# plus the notebook tooling.
-r requirements-train.in
-c requirements-train.txt
